---
import MentionChip from "@/components/MentionChip.astro";
---

<section id="product" class="border-b border-night-hairline bg-night-soft px-6 py-24 md:px-10 md:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr] lg:items-center">
    <div>
      <p class="mb-4 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-night-faint">
        The universal connector
      </p>
      <h2 class="font-sans text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.025em] text-night-text md:text-6xl">
        One keystroke. <span class="text-night-muted">Anything in your workspace.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-night-soft-text">
        Every note, file, chat, project, event, and person has a URN. Type
        <span class="font-mono font-medium text-night-text">@</span> in any text field and pull
        them in with full context. No copy-paste. No "where did I save that?"
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-8 space-y-3 font-mono text-sm text-night-soft-text">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-2 h-1 w-4 bg-night-text"></span>
          <span>Mention notes, files, chats, projects, events, users</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-2 h-1 w-4 bg-night-text"></span>
          <span>Bi-directional backlinks across every domain</span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="mt-2 h-1 w-4 bg-night-text"></span>
          <span>Live previews, not dead URLs</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-night-hairline bg-night shadow-sm">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-night-hairline px-5 py-3">
        <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-rose-400"></span>
        <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400"></span>
        <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
        <span class="ml-3 font-mono text-xs text-night-faint">#engineering</span>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5 p-6 md:p-8">
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <div class="grid h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 font-mono text-sm font-medium text-white">S</div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="mb-1 flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span class="font-medium text-night-text">Sara</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-night-faint">10:42</span>
            </div>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-night-text">
              Pulled the latest numbers into <MentionChip type="note" label="roadmap-q3" /> &mdash; let&rsquo;s sync after <MentionChip type="event" label="planning-call" />.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <div class="grid h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-violet-500 font-mono text-sm font-medium text-white">M</div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="mb-1 flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span class="font-medium text-night-text">Marko</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-night-faint">10:43</span>
            </div>
            <p class="leading-relaxed text-night-text">
              Attaching <MentionChip type="file" label="budget-2026" badge="xlsx" />. Cc <MentionChip type="user" label="lena" /> for sign-off.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <div class="grid h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-paper font-mono text-sm font-medium text-accent">@</div>
          <div class="flex-1">
            <div class="mb-1 flex items-baseline gap-2">
              <span class="font-medium text-night-text">Spaces AI</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-xs text-night-faint">10:43</span>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-lg border border-night-hairline bg-night-soft p-4 leading-relaxed text-night-soft-text">
              Based on <MentionChip type="note" label="roadmap-q3" /> and <MentionChip type="file" label="budget-2026" badge="xlsx" />, the launch window is on track. Two risks flagged in <MentionChip type="note" label="risk-register" />.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-night-hairline bg-night-soft px-4 py-3 font-mono text-sm text-night-faint">
          <span class="text-night-text">@</span>
          <span class="flex-1">type to mention anything&hellip;</span>
          <span class="h-4 w-0.5 animate-pulse bg-night-text"></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
